sanctioned: this program uses Ipe.Db kernels (Db.open / Db.withTransaction / Ipe.Db.Unsafe.unsafeExecRaw / Db.exec / Db.queryDecode / Db.Decode.decimal) — the Go backend emits Go+SQLite (cgo) binaries while Ipê emits Rust+sqlx; the SQLite in-memory connection-pool behaviour and row-type representation differ enough that a shared Main.ipe cannot run on both backends. Ipê's output is the correct reference. `Db.Decode.decimal` is Ipê-new with no ancestor equivalent.
